{"id":"06b922dee885fdeee7e923a52517dadb","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"MiniMax-M3","content":[{"thinking":"The user wants me to calculate 847 * 263. Let me work this out carefully.\n\n847 × 263\n\nI'll break this down using the standard multiplication algorithm, or I can use the distributive property.\n\nMethod: 847 × 263 = 847 × (200 + 60 + 3)\n\n847 × 200 = 169,400\n847 × 60 = 50,820\n847 × 3 = 2,541\n\nSum: 169,400 + 50,820 + 2,541\n\n169,400 + 50,820 = 220,220\n220,220 + 2,541 = 222,761\n\nLet me verify with another method:\n847 × 263\n= 847 × 263\n\nLet me do it as:\n800 × 263 = 210,400\n47 × 263 = ?\n  40 × 263 = 10,520\n  7 × 263 = 1,841\n  47 × 263 = 10,520 + 1,841 = 12,361\n\nTotal: 210,400 + 12,361 = 222,761\n\nLet me double-check by another method:\n847 × 263\n847 × 263 = (850 - 3) × 263\n= 850 × 263 - 3 × 263\n850 × 263 = ?\n  800 × 263 = 210,400\n  50 × 263 = 13,150\n  850 × 263 = 210,400 + 13,150 = 223,550\n3 × 263 = 789\n850 × 263 - 3 × 263 = 223,550 - 789 = 222,761\n\nGreat, the answer is 222,761.","signature":"350e0452fc82e17604b0c50ebd78e97367104857a1de1f1785f69569d01d307a","type":"thinking"},{"text":"# Calculating 847 × 263\n\nI'll use the distributive property by breaking 263 into parts:\n\n**Step 1:** Split the multiplication\n$$847 \\times 263 = 847 \\times (200 + 60 + 3)$$\n\n**Step 2:** Compute each part\n\n| Part | Calculation | Result |\n|------|-------------|--------|\n| 847 × 200 | 847 × 2 × 100 | 169,400 |\n| 847 × 60  | 847 × 6 × 10  | 50,820 |\n| 847 × 3   |               | 2,541 |\n\n**Step 3:** Add the results\n\n$$169{,}400 + 50{,}820 = 220{,}220$$\n\n$$220{,}220 + 2{,}541 = 222{,}761$$\n\n## Answer\n\n$$847 \\times 263 = \\boxed{222{,}761}$$","type":"text"}],"usage":{"input_tokens":60,"output_tokens":576,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":128,"service_tier":"standard"},"stop_reason":"end_turn","base_resp":{"status_code":0,"status_msg":""}}